author zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790600674 +0900
committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790600674 +0900

Add calendar official-semantics simulator and E4 driver

calsync.sim: server with change log, etags, sync-token paging, visibility
lag, token expiry and seeded 410 Gone; compliant adapter with full resync
on 410 and conditional writes with re-read on 412; delivered-stream and
state-divergence helpers. E4 builds HoldMem (D=1, B in {0,1}) and the zero
system on each stream (ideal and official at L in {1,5,30} min) over the
calendar slots, probes just after true calendar changes, and analyses the
official-minus-ideal drop and its interaction with B. 410 probability is
set to 0.001 per poll and E4 uses the S_src branch (decisions.md).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
